<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech Severoceske posts CZK 1.1bln 96 net.</title>
<headline>Czech Severoceske posts CZK 1.1bln 96 net.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for year ending December 31, 1996 (in millions of crowns).</p>
<p>			    1996     vs	1995</p>
<p> Net profit	     1,100		 800</p>
<p> Sales		    9,500	     7,600</p>
<p> Write offs	     1,100	     1,200</p>
<p> Assets		  15,000	    15,000</p>
<p>Note: Figures for 1996 are preliminary. The company's full name is Severoceske Doly a.s. A company spokesman said the board would propose a 40 crown gross dividend on 1996 profits, the same as in 1995. It is one of the Czech Republic's biggest mining companies. Its shares are quoted on the main market of the Prague Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
